        <strong>Who we're simulating.</strong> A traveler who doesn't pay
        for any AI subscription and just opens the free version of
        whichever chatbot they already use. So that's exactly what we
        tested: a brand-new Google account, signed in to the free tier of
        each service, using the model each one serves by default.
      </p>

