- Trip 1: March 14–21, 2025
- Trip 2: April 18 – July 2, 2025
- Trip 3: September 19–26, 2025
- Trip 4: November 27 – December 30, 2025

As of December 31, 2025, what is the earliest date on which Jordan could begin a brand-new 90-day stay in the Schengen Area, using a full 90-day allowance? Give a specific date and briefly explain your reasoning.</pre>
      </details>
      <p class="known-answer">Both calculators: March 31, 2026.</p>

